# estimate_merging_time on a real R0 satellite subhalo and its FoF mother halo.
# End-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time state.
# Source: R0 reference /Volumes/Internal/results/sage26-campaign/workspace/e01-reference/out/R0/model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 6d859a3a2ea422e31ec04a403221d5a477c49f4dfdba303082dc59f1c6003399), Snap_32 rows 15443 (GalaxyIndex 3000057000000068, Type 0) and 15444 (GalaxyIndex 3000057000000071, Type 1).
# SnapNum: the rows store 32; the galaxies' SnapNum 31 is a constructed call-time value (the
# snapshot they arrive from), and the halo snapshot is 32 (ZZ from a scratch restatement of
# SAGE26's time_to_present on the run's a_list, R/src/core_init.c:159-206).
# Halo 0 is the mother (the central's Len and Mvir), halo 1 the satellite's subhalo.
# Reachability: R0-reachable.
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine estimate_merging_time

f64 params.PartMass 0x3fb604189374bc6a  # 0.086  (R0.par:41)
f64 params.MergerTimeFactor 0x4000000000000000  # 2.0  (default, R/src/core_read_parameter_file.c:128)
